---
const currentYear = 2026;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-connect">
      <a href="/" class="connect-icon" aria-label="Next-Gen Fridays Home">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 640 512" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M96 224c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64s-28.7-64-64-64-64 28.7-64 64 28.7 64 64 64zm448 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64s-28.7-64-64-64-64 28.7-64 64 28.7 64 64 64zm32 32h-64c-17.6 0-33.5 7.1-45.1 18.6 40.3 22.1 68.9 62 75.1 109.4h66c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32v-32c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64zm-256 0c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112S381.9 32 320 32 208 82.1 208 144s50.1 112 112 112zm76.8 32h-8.3c-20.8 10-43.9 16-68.5 16s-47.6-6-68.5-16h-8.3C179.6 288 128 339.6 128 403.2V432c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h288c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-28.8c0-63.6-51.6-115.2-115.2-115.2zm-223.7-13.4C161.5 263.1 145.6 256 128 256H64c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v32c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h65.9c6.3-47.4 34.9-87.3 75.2-109.4z" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <div class="connect-copy">
        <p class="connect-text">The show’s on pause. The curiosity isn’t.</p>
        <p class="connect-subtext">
          Follow what I’m up to now →{' '}
          <a href="https://chrislatham.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">chrislatham.ca<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>
          <span class="connect-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="https://thelatham.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">thelatham.net<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="footer-credit">
        Created by <a href="https://chrislatham.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chris MBS Latham<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a> <span aria-hidden="true">🍔</span> with support of the AI Robots
      </p>
      <p class="footer-copyright">
        © {currentYear}, Chris Latham
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: var(--space-3xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-charcoal-elevated);
    background-color: var(--color-obsidian-base);
    padding: 3.5rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .footer-connect {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(52, 52, 52, 0.6);
  }

  .connect-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-default);
    background-color: rgba(236, 0, 68, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(236, 0, 68, 0.3);
    color: var(--color-neon-crimson);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .connect-icon:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background-color: rgba(236, 0, 68, 0.22);
    color: var(--color-pure-white);
  }

  .connect-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-pure-white);
  }

  .connect-subtext {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-muted);
  }

  .connect-subtext a {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-crimson-text);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .connect-subtext a:hover {
    color: var(--color-kinetic-vermilion);
  }

  .connect-sep {
    margin: 0 0.375rem;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-subtle);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-muted);
  }

  .footer-credit,
  .footer-copyright {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-credit a {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-crimson-text);
  }

  .footer-credit a:hover {
    color: var(--color-kinetic-vermilion);
  }
</style>
